OL,3,GNEWSAJury discharged after murder trial
OL,4,Acollapses
OL,5,
OL,6,FA jury in the trial of a man accused of
OL,7,Fmurder after a car was driven into a
OL,8,Fcrowd of people in Nottinghamshire has
OL,9,Fbeen discharged.
OL,11,FDuane Anthony, 40, of Marton Road in
OL,12,FBulwell, had denied one count of murder
OL,13,Fand five counts of attempted murder
OL,14,Fafter five people were hit by a car in
OL,15,FGedling Road in Arnold on 9 May. Tyler
OL,16,FFairman, 26, died from his injuries
OL,17,Fthree days later.
OL,19,FAnthony's partner - Destiny Carrier,
OL,20,F29, of Lothair Road, Leicester - had
OL,21,Fdenied assisting an offender.
OL,23,APub: 27-OctQppppppppppppppppppppppG1/2
