OL,3,GNEWSAJury discharged after murder trial
OL,4,Acollapses
OL,5,
OL,6,FOn Tuesday, the jury at Nottingham
OL,7,FCrown Court was dismissed for legal
OL,8,Freasons. A new trial date has been set
OL,9,Ffor 4 January.
